concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-abolition-of-limited-merits-review-act-2017-sch-1-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 After section 44AI"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: 44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions  A decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however described) by a body established under a law of a State or Territory." ;
    skos:definition "Insert: 44AIA  No merits review of AER decisions  A decision of the AER under a State/Territory energy law or local energy instrument is not to be subject to merits review (however described) by a body established under a law of a State or Territory."@en ;
